{"id": "19-683-2-6", "zh": "138. yo 变为 eṭa", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-684-2-8", "zh": "在以 a 结尾的 sabba 等词之后，yo 总是变为 eṭa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-684-9-10", "zh": "sabbe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-684-11-16", "zh": "bho sabba、sabbā，sabbe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-684-17-20", "zh": "sabbaṃ，sabbe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-684-21-25", "zh": "sabbena，sabbehi、sabbebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-684-26-28", "zh": "具格也是这样。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-684-29-30", "zh": "sabbassa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-685-2-6", "zh": "99. sabba 等词在 naṃ 之前也是这样", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-686-2-11", "zh": "以 a 结尾的 sabba 等词，在 naṃ 以及 su、hi 之前，词尾变为 e。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-686-12-17", "zh": "这里的 ādi（等）一词表示“部分”，因为有这样的说法：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-687-2-10", "zh": "表示界限、表示类别，同样也表示邻近、表示部分；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-688-2-9", "zh": "有智慧的人应当说明，ādi 一词用于这四种意义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-689-2-6", "zh": "100. 变为 saṃ 与 sānaṃ", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-690-2-8", "zh": "在 sabba 等词之后，naṃ 格尾变为 saṃ 和 sānaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-690-9-11", "zh": "sabbesaṃ、sabbesānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-690-12-15", "zh": "sabbā、sabbamhā、sabbasmā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-690-16-21", "zh": "sabbe、sabbamhi、sabbasmiṃ，sabbesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-691-2-14", "zh": "在阴性中，依“itthiyamatvā”规则加上 ā 词缀后，这个词缀得名为 gha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-691-15-17", "zh": "其余的变化与 kaññā 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-691-18-22", "zh": "sabbā，sabbā、sabbāyo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-691-23-28", "zh": "bho sabbe，sabbā、sabbāyo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-691-29-49", "zh": "依“gho ssaṃssāssāyaṃtiṃsu”规则变为短音，得 sabbaṃ；sabbā、sabbāyo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-691-50-54", "zh": "sabbāya，sabbāhi、sabbābhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-692-2-7", "zh": "101. 在 gha、pa 之后，sa 可以变为 ssā", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-693-2-8", "zh": "在 sabba 等词的 gha、pa 之后，sa 可以变为 ssā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-693-9-30", "zh": "amussā 这个词形已经由“ssā vā tetimāmūhi”规则的 ssā 替换而成立，所以这里取 vā（或）字是为了后面的规则。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-693-31-37", "zh": "变为短音后得 sabbassā，又有 sabbāya；sabbāsaṃ、sabbāsānaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-693-38-40", "zh": "第五格（从格）为 sabbāya。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-694-2-5", "zh": "102. smiṃ 变为 ssaṃ", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-695-2-8", "zh": "在 sabba 等词的 gha、pa 之后，smiṃ 可以变为 ssaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-695-9-14", "zh": "sabbassaṃ、sabbāyaṃ、sabbāya，sabbāsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-696-2-4", "zh": "中性为 sabbaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-696-5-15", "zh": "依“yonaṃ nī”规则，在中性中 yo 变为 ni 的时候——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-697-2-4", "zh": "137. 在 sabba 等词之后", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-698-2-8", "zh": "在 sabba 等词之后的 ni 不变为 ṭā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-698-9-11", "zh": "变为长音后得 sabbāni。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-698-12-17", "zh": "bho sabba、sabbā，sabbāni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-698-18-22", "zh": "sabbaṃ，sabbe、sabbāni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-698-23-25", "zh": "从 nā 开始的各格与阳性相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-698-26-30", "zh": "katara、katama、ubhaya 在三种性中都与 sabba 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-698-31-33", "zh": "itara、añña 这些词也是这样。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-698-34-38", "zh": "区别在于 ssā 和 ssaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-699-2-18", "zh": "52. 在 ssaṃ、ssā、ssāya 之前，itara、eka、añña、eta、ima 变为 i", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-700-2-16", "zh": "在 ssaṃ 等格尾之前，itara、eka、añña、eta、ima 这些词的词尾总是变为 i。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-700-17-26", "zh": "itarissā、itarāya，aññissā、aññāya，aññāsaṃ、aññāsānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-700-27-30", "zh": "aññissaṃ、aññāyaṃ、aññāya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-700-31-36", "zh": "aññatara、aññatama 在三种性中都与 sabba 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-701-2-3", "zh": "pubbo，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-702-2-5", "zh": "143. 在 pubba 等六个词之后", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-703-2-13", "zh": "在这六个词之后，在它们适用的范围内可以变为 eṭa，所以 yo 变为 eṭa，得 pubbe，又有 pubbā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-703-14-20", "zh": "bho pubba、pubbā，pubbe、pubbā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-703-21-24", "zh": "pubbaṃ，pubbe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-703-25-26", "zh": "pubbena。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-703-27-30", "zh": "其余的在各种性中都与 sabba 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-703-31-34", "zh": "para 等五个词也是这样。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-704-2-9", "zh": "139. 作为专名或非主要成分时，不适用", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-705-2-9", "zh": "sabba 等词作为专名时，或作为非主要成分时，不进行 sabba 等词特有的变化。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-705-10-16", "zh": "te sabbā，意思是：他们名叫 Sabba。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-705-17-22", "zh": "te piyasabbā，te atisabbā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-705-23-42", "zh": "由于只在作为专名时，以及在有财释等以非主要成分出现的情况下，才禁止 sabba 等词特有的变化，所以像“paramasabbe tiṭṭhanti”等，在以主要成分结尾的词之后，eṭa 等变化仍然成立，因为持业释以后分的意义为主。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-706-2-4", "zh": "140. 与第三格意义相连时", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-707-2-8", "zh": "与第三格（具格）的意义相连时，也不进行 sabba 等词特有的变化。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-707-9-13", "zh": "早一个月的（māsena pubbā）成为 māsapubbā，等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-708-2-4", "zh": "141. 在相违释中", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-709-2-6", "zh": "在相违释（ca 义复合词）的范围内，不进行 sabba 等词特有的变化。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-709-7-8", "zh": "例如 dakkhiṇuttarapubbānaṃ 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-710-2-6", "zh": "142. 或者变为 eṭa", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-711-2-13", "zh": "上面说了在相违释中不进行 sabba 等词特有的变化；而 eṭa 替换本来按常规必然出现，这里是对已适用者的选择规则。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-711-14-16", "zh": "pubbuttare、pubbuttarā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-711-17-19", "zh": "其余的与 sugata 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-712-2-5", "zh": "yo，ye。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-712-6-9", "zh": "yā，yāyo。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-712-10-15", "zh": "yaṃ，yāni，等等，都与 sabba 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-712-16-22", "zh": "ya 等词没有呼格形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-713-2-4", "zh": "ta 加上 si 时——", "confidence": 45}
